  19:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c ****  *     Application layer configuration template for the D-Bus-2 and CAN Bus
  20:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c ****  *     
  21:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c ****  *     This layer handles the message distribution of the system messages. Received messages, which
  22:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c ****  *     system messages (differentiation according to the identifier) will be distributed to the
  23:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c ****  *     subsystem corresponding to either the subsystem addressed (when addressed subsystem differs 
  24:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c ****  *     or to the subsystem, which is indirectly addressed via a service function in the correspondi
  25:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c ****  *     table.
  26:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c ****  *       \image html bal.gif
  27:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c ****  *
  28:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c ****  */
