  87:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c ****  BAL_MAX_TRANSMISSION_RETRIES_AFTER_COLLISION: A message, which is aborted, due to a collision,
  88:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c ****  must be repeated in order for any recipient to be able to receive the message correctly.
ARM GAS  C:\Users\SX2605~1.HOD\AppData\Local\Temp\cc3tmnOf.s 			page 3


  89:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c ****  In case a node has a hardware defect in the bus interface, it can be advantageous to define a
  90:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c ****  definite amount of retries for a message after an occurred collision. This value should be
  91:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c ****  at least as large as the expected maximum amount of succeeding collisions in the system (e.g. 16).
  92:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c **** */
  93:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c **** #define BAL_MAX_TRANSMISSION_RETRIES_AFTER_COLLISION    16
  94:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c **** 
  95:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c **** /**
  96:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c ****  BAL_MAX_TRANSMISSION_RETRIES_AFTER_MISSING_ACKNOWLEDGE: A message, which cannot be received on fir
  97:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c ****  (e.g. while the addressed node is not present, or broken), will be retried this many times,
  98:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c ****  before the corresponding transmit flag is reset.
  99:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c **** */
 100:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c **** #define BAL_MAX_TRANSMISSION_RETRIES_AFTER_MISSING_ACKNOWLEDGE    4
 101:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c **** 
 102:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c **** /**
 103:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c ****  BAL_MAX_TRANSMISSION_RETRIES_AFTER_NEGATIVE_ACKNOWLEDGE: A message, which is not correctly receive
 104:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c ****  by the receiving node, will be retried this many times, before the corresponding transmit flag is 
 105:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c **** */
 106:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c **** #define BAL_MAX_TRANSMISSION_RETRIES_AFTER_NEGATIVE_ACKNOWLEDGE    2
 107:common/prog/dbus/cfg_templates/balXs.c **** #endif //!DBM_DBUSCAN
